00:00:00.030 --> 00:00:04.830
Film Courage: When should someone quit their day job
so become a full-time filmmaker/director?

00:00:04.830 --> 00:00:10.920
Matt Eskandari, Filmmaker: That's interesting question. I think
that's always a challenge is because

00:00:10.920 --> 00:00:14.130
I've had I've had to work with that
challenge as well as like when you quit

00:00:14.130 --> 00:00:19.699
your day job and focus just on your
passions directing writing producing

00:00:19.699 --> 00:00:25.710
