early on in my career you know I was

00:00:25.710 --> 00:00:29.460
lucky I said I was you know young and I
got to direct a couple movies before the

00:00:29.460 --> 00:00:35.790
age of 26 and and then there was like
2009-2010 and then the whole economic

00:00:35.790 --> 00:00:40.820
recession happened and you know trying
to maintain myself as a director

00:00:40.820 --> 00:00:45.329
