fine like I'm starting to sell scripts

00:01:06.240 --> 00:01:11.640
again I just did another film I got an
agent now I got a manager I can focus

00:01:11.640 --> 00:01:18.630
more on this path so it's and that's why
I've said it so many times to other to

00:01:18.630 --> 00:01:24.259
other aspiring filmmakers and directors
is your career is never gonna be

00:01:24.259 --> 00:01:29.759
sometimes it is sometimes some people
are lucky and they hit it big somebody

00:01:29.759 --> 00:01:34.020
sees their short films Steven Spielberg
sees their short film or James Bond sees

